          "jcr:created": "Tue Jun 04 2024 16:22:57 GMT+0000",
          "text": "<p><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\"><span style=\"color: #1c5687;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\">SPY-PHI</span></span></span></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">A handheld solution for perfusion assessment</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">The first fluorescence imaging system and fluorescence imaging agent on-label for visualization of lymph nodes and lymphatic vessels during lymphatic mapping in adults with breast cancer<sup>1</sup></span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><a title=\"Lean more about SPY-PHI\" href=\"/content/stryker/us/en/endoscopy/products/spy-phi.html\" target=\"_blank\"><span class=\"standalone-link\">Learn more</span></a></p>\n",
