          "jcr:created": "Tue Jun 04 2024 16:22:57 GMT+0000",
          "text": "<p><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\"><span style=\"color: #1c5687;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\">MOLLI</span></span></span></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Wire-free soft tissue tumor localization technology</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Easy to use, reliable, 3D Directionality<sup>2</sup></span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><a title=\"Learn more about MOLLI\" href=\"/content/stryker/us/en/endoscopy/products/molli.html\" target=\"_blank\"><span class=\"standalone-link\">Learn more</span></a></p>\n",
