          "text": "<p><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\"><span style=\"color: #1c5687;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Invuity</span></span></span></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Thermally cool illumination<sup>3</sup></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Up to 22x more light output than battery powered disposable retractors<sup>4</sup></span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><a title=\"Learn more about Invuity\" href=\"/content/stryker/us/en/portfolios/medical-surgical-equipment/illuminated-instruments.html\" target=\"_blank\"><span class=\"standalone-link\">Learn more</span></a></p>\n",
