          "text": "<p><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\"><span style=\"color: #1c5687;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\">DermACELL</span></span></span></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Decelluralized regenerative human tissue matirx allograft</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Sterility Assurance Level (SAL) of 10<sup>-6</sup> and has a 1 in 1,000,000 chance of one viable microorganism on the graft.<sup>5</sup></span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span class=\"standalone-link\"><a title=\"Learn more about DermACELL\" href=\"/content/stryker/us/en/endoscopy/products/dermacell.html\" target=\"_blank\">Learn more</a></span></p>\n",
